        "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/chatwoot/chatwoot/tarball/v4.19.0",
        "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/chatwoot/chatwoot/zipball/v4.19.0",
        "body": "## Changelog\r\n\r\n- Automatic conversation translation with Captain or Google Translate. [Enterprise]\r\n- Conversation monitors, AI automation conditions, and label and priority suggestions. [Enterprise]\r\n- Refreshed Captain reports, Copilot chat history, and low-credit alerts. [Enterprise]\r\n- Captain toolset catalog and customer verification for sensitive tools. [Enterprise]\r\n- Email forwarding, subject search, tables, and improved quoted history.\r\n- WhatsApp campaign history, batch sending, and delivery analytics.\r\n- Mobile call ringing, missed-call notifications, and improved Twilio handling. [Enterprise]\r\n- Expanded Companies CRM, company enrichment, and Stripe billing details in conversations.\r\n- Shopify App Store onboarding and billing setup.\r\n- Bulk macros, conversation reading mode, and a collapsible reply editor.\r\n- Editable Help Center article URLs and improved language switching.\r\n- Bearer authentication for existing API tokens.\r\n- Configurable message search windows and auto-resolution schedules.\r\n- Account-wide two-factor enforcement and optional Cloud device verification.\r\n- Redesigned Super Admin with user and email delivery diagnostics.\r\n- Security hardening, dependency updates, bug fixes, and performance improvements.\r\n\r\n\r\n> Captain V1 has been retired. Self-hosted installations using V1 instructions must migrate them to V2 before upgrading. See the [migration guide](https://github.com/chatwoot/chatwoot/blob/v4.19.0/docs/captain_v1_sunset.md).\r\n\r\n\r\n> We recommend upgrading to v4.19.0 for the latest security fixes and hardening improvements.\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks to @breken-ai, @chiliec, @emilienlefort, @gabrieljablonski, @gihovani, @Kshot3000, @no-hup, @vaibhavmashal, @vivekmiyani, @Will-thom for the contributions.",
