          "message": "chore: include auto translate in cloud plan features (#16347)\n\n# Pull Request Template\n\n## Description\n\nAdds auto translate to plan feature reconciliation, so Startups,\nBusiness, and Enterprise Cloud accounts get it with their plan. Existing\naccounts will be enabled with a manual migration.\n\n## Type of change\n\n- [x] New feature (non-breaking change which adds functionality)\n\n\n## Checklist:\n\n- [x] My code follows the style guidelines of this project\n- [x] I have performed a self-review of my code\n- [ ] I have commented on my code, particularly in hard-to-understand\nareas\n- [ ] I have made corresponding changes to the documentation\n- [x] My changes generate no new warnings\n- [ ] I have added tests that prove my fix is effective or that my\nfeature works\n- [x] New and existing unit tests pass locally with my changes\n- [ ] Any dependent changes have been merged and published in downstream\nmodules",
